1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:02,250
For every finished video,

2
00:00:02,250 --> 00:00:03,470
the system creates its own

3
00:00:03,470 --> 00:00:05,750
reverse-engineering document.

4
00:00:05,850 --> 00:00:08,000
This records how the video was made,

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,210
including the prompts,

6
00:00:09,210 --> 00:00:10,890
structure, methods used,

7
00:00:10,890 --> 00:00:13,000
revisions, and key learnings.

8
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:14,720
The workflow also checks

9
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:15,680
that this file exists

10
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:16,450
before the video

11
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:18,500
can be marked complete.
